---Groups
	must contain: title, description, being able to invite other users
	once a user is part of a group: 
					*** he can invite other users to join the group
					*** he can also create posts and comment posts already created
					*** these posts and comments will be displayed to other members of the group
					*** he can create Event making it available for other members of the group:
								**** Event must contain: Title, Description, Day/Time, 2 options: Going or Not going
											
	---> users can also require to be part of the group and for that only the creator of that group will receive a notification (accept/deny)
	
---Chat
	Using Websockets
	to be able to chat with someone at least one of users must be following the other
	be able to send emojis	
	A chat room for every group

---Notification
	private messages and new notification should be displayed in a different way
	the User should be notified when:
		*** he has a private profile and someone sends a following request
		*** he Receives a group invitation
		*** if the user is the owner of a group and he receives request from other users to join the group
		*** he is member of a group and an event is created
